		(property "Notes" "Supervisor de +3V3_D + watchdog, AEC-Q100 (TI SGLS143E). VIT- 2.84/2.93/3.0 V, reset 120/200/300 ms, ttout 0.9/1.6/2.5 s. RESET drenador abierto (TPS3828) -> MCU_RST_N (wire-OR con R401 10k + C403 1 uF + SW401). WDI en alta impedancia = watchdog deshabilitado (7.3.4): GPIO17 queda en alta Z en boot/flasheo. Simbolo oficial TPS3823-xxDBV: mismo pinout (1 RESET, 2 GND, 3 MR, 4 WDI, 5 VDD)."
			(at 0 0 0)
			(unlocked yes)
			(layer "F.Fab")
			(hide yes)
			(uuid "a78e6732-dff0-4f8f-b543-71d879988c78")
